{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買わなくてはならないものを\n思い出せない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 4期生 岩手県出身"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤璃果です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ5MWMQPQNSZ3ENQ5VGA9VJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先に林の写真を出させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ昔の写真です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るかちゃんと読み間違えられますが、\n林と瑠璃というコンビ名がついてからは\nそれも微笑ましく思えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ5MXMWK3TZYQD8H3N27P74","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"林のブログにも書いてあったのですが\n一緒に歌いたいねと話していました。\nその話ができて\nとても嬉しいかったです（*＾＾*)\n "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう6月ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりの方も初めましての方も\nもうすぐ皆さんとお話できる事が\nとても嬉しいです！！\nあと9日。楽しみですね〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▓▓‹:)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お松に伝授してもらいました✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜〜質問〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん面白い質問があったので答えます✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前のブログにしてくれた質問もあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇そういや5月なのにもう梅雨入りしてるけど、璃果ちゃんは雨の日に何かすることとかある？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いお洋服ないかなって\nずっと目を光らせてます！ʕ·ᴥ·ʔ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇璃果ちゃんは海鮮丼派ですか??寿司派ですか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寿司！！\nもっと言うとお刺身とかも好きです。\n海鮮丼もいいですよね〜(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇学生時代に愛用していたシャーペンってあるかな？ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっとクルトガを使ってました✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇好きな卵料理はなに〜？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オムレツ〜！ゆで卵！だし巻き玉子！\n茶碗蒸し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇10代のうちにやっておきたい！！ってことは何かありますか？ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に無くて困ります(´△`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇璃果ちゃんはオムレツの上には何をかける？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中にチーズが入っている\nオムレツが大好きです。\n上にはなにもかけてないですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇りかちゃんは車の免許を取りたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取りたいけどちょっと怖いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇オムレツ語ってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだあの濃厚でまろやかな味は...！\n食感も柔らかくてとろけて、尚更チーズなんて入ってい